oin**.\n\n✦ **Saturday, October 31, 10am to 12pm** (please come 5 to 10 min early)\n✦ 191 New Toronto Street, Etobicoke (Lake Shore Blvd W \u0026 Islington)\n✦ Free parking, or the 110C bus from Islington Station\n✦ **Closed-toe shoes please**\n✦ Ages 18+\n\n**How to join**\n\n1. Create your Toronto Joy account. It's one time only and takes about 3 minutes.\n\n[https://torontojoy.org/register/](https://torontojoy.org/register/)\n\n2. Register on the event page by **Friday, October 16**:\n\nhttps://torontojoy.org/event/volunteer-at-daily-bread-food-bank/\n\nAlready have an account? Skip to step 2.\n\nOnly people registered on our website can take a spot.\n\nOnce you're registered, I'll send you Daily Bread's waiver to sign and our WhatsApp group link for day-of updates.\n\nIf you sign up, please do so with the intention of attending... Daily Bread is counting on us.\n\nWould be great to serve together! ❤️\nAmar and Team","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-joy/events/316785581/","isAttending":false,"isSaved":false,"maxTickets":8,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:536389945"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:536389945"},"feeSettings":null,"group":{"__ref":"Group:37379868"},"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":3,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:402754974"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:392130538"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:422188806"}}}]},"series":null,"venue":{"__typename":"Venue","name":"191 New Toronto St","address":"191 New Toronto St, Etobicoke, ON M8V 2E7, Canada","city":"Toronto","state":"ON","country":"ca"}},"RecommendedEventsEdge:{\"node\":{\"id\":\"316785581\"}}":{"__typename":"RecommendedEventsEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:316785581","id":"316785581"},"met